        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/thejaymann/{size}/2261_2.png",
        "created_at": "2011-08-17T10:40:53.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>That’s how I typically play with Ra and Absolute Zero together, especially if I have both Isothermic Transducer and Coolant Blast both in play, as without any damage modifiers, this multiplies the damage two fold.</p>\n<p>And, yes, Chris, that answers my question.</p>",
